:GRAPH Transmission_by_type
:TITLE Transmission km
:Y-DIV 10
:STACK-FILL 0
:SCALE
:VAR Interconnection km|for Interconnection
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 128-128-128
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Transmission for Generation Connection|for Generation
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 0-255-255
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Transmission for Demand Connection|for Demand
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 255-160-55
:LINE-WIDTH 1

:GRAPH Generation_Capacity_Availability_&_Residual_Demand
:TITLE Generation Capacity, Availability and Demand
:X-AXIS time
:X-LABEL Date
:SCALE
:VAR Total Generation Capacity|Installed Capacity
:UNITS MW
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 0-128-0
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Residual Demand[f0,H12]|Residual Demand 12:00
:UNITS MW
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 255-176-138
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Residual Demand[f0,H20]|Residual Demand 20:00
:UNITS MW
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 108-108-255
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Total Expected Available Generation[f0,H12]|Available Generation 12:00
:UNITS MW
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 255-128-64
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Total Expected Available Generation[f0,H20]|Available Generation 20:00
:UNITS MW
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 0-0-255
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR National Peak Demand[f0]|Peak Demand
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 255-0-0
:LINE-WIDTH 1

:GRAPH Imbalances_and_Interconnection_Z1
:TITLE Imbalances and Interconnection Z1
:X-DIV 5
:Y-DIV 10
:SCALE
:VAR Imbalance by Zone[f0,H12,Z1]|12:00
:UNITS MWh
:Y-MIN -15000
:Y-MAX 15000
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 255-128-64
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Imbalance by Zone[f0,H20,Z1]|20:00
:UNITS MWh
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 0-0-255
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Interconnection Capacity[Z1]|Interconnection
:UNITS MW
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 0-128-0
:LINE-WIDTH 2

:GRAPH DER_Capacity_vs_Generation
:TITLE DER Capacity vs. Generation
:Y-DIV 6
:SCALE
:VAR Total DER Generation[H12]|Generation 12:00
:UNITS MWh
:Y-MAX 30000
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Total DER Capacity|Installed Capacity
:UNITS MW
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 1

:GRAPH Reservoir_level
